1. Refresh button also refreshes the study-reassignment combo
vb
Private Sub cmdRefresh_Click()
    RefreshFromTechFilter
    Me.subExternalShipmentsList.Form.colStudyNumber.Requery
End Sub

colStudyNumber's Row Source is its own separate query, independent of the form's RecordSource — requerying the form doesn't touch it, so it needs this explicit call.

2. Study Number search box (Table 2)

Add a Text Box to fsubExternalShipments, positioned above subStudyFilterList:

Name: txtStudySearch
vb
Private Sub txtStudySearch_Change()
    Dim searchText As String
    searchText = Me.txtStudySearch.Text

    If searchText = "" Then
        Me.subStudyFilterList.Form.FilterOn = False
    Else
        Me.subStudyFilterList.Form.Filter = "DisplayText LIKE '*" & Replace(searchText, "'", "''") & "*'"
        Me.subStudyFilterList.Form.FilterOn = True
    End If
End Sub

Worth knowing: this filters on DisplayText (which is StudyNumber | Matrix), so typing text that happens to match part of a Matrix name could also surface a row — acceptable for a quick filter, but flag if you want it stricter (matching only the StudyNumber portion). Also, typing anything hides the "-- Show All --" row since it won't match a real study number — clearing the box brings it back.

3. Show/hide Watson-logged shipments checkbox

Add a Check Box to fsubExternalShipments:

Name: chkShowWatsonLogged
Label Caption: "Show Watson Logged"

Form_Load — add one line to set the default:

vb
Me.chkShowWatsonLogged.Value = False

RefreshTable3 — make the WatsonLogged filter conditional:

vb
Private Sub RefreshTable3()
    Dim checkedIDs As String
    checkedIDs = GetCheckedTechIDs()

    Dim sql As String
    sql = "SELECT sh.ShipmentID, sh.SR, sh.DeliveryDate, st.StudyNumber, st.Matrix, sh.Waybill, sh.Samples, sh.Boxes, " & _
          "sh.Condition, sh.SplitType, st.StorageTemp, sh.StudyID, sh.ShipmentStatus, " & _
          "IIf(Len(Trim(Nz(st.StudyNumber,''))) > 0 " & _
          "And Len(Trim(Nz(st.Matrix,''))) > 0 " & _
          "And Len(Trim(Nz(st.MonitorEmail,''))) > 0 " & _
          "And Len(Trim(Nz(st.ScientistEmail,''))) > 0 " & _
          "And Len(Trim(Nz(st.StudyDirectorEmail,''))) > 0, " & _
          "'Complete', 'Missing') AS StudyInfo " & _
          "FROM tblShipments sh INNER JOIN tblStudies st ON sh.StudyID = st.StudyID " & _
          "WHERE ((st.SponsorProtocol='NO RECORD' AND st.Tech1ID Is Null) OR st.Tech1ID In (" & checkedIDs & ")) "

    If Me.chkShowWatsonLogged.Value = False Then
        sql = sql & "AND sh.WatsonLogged = False "
    End If

    If selectedStudyID <> 0 Then
        sql = sql & "AND st.StudyID = " & selectedStudyID & " "
    End If
    sql = sql & "ORDER BY sh.DeliveryDate DESC"

    Me.subExternalShipmentsList.Form.RecordSource = sql
    Me.subExternalShipmentsList.Form.Requery
End Sub

Add the trigger:

vb
Private Sub chkShowWatsonLogged_AfterUpdate()
    RefreshTable3
End Sub
